um/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1259978-cofd-to-be-added-to-the-storyteller-s-vault?p=1261350#post1261350\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know,Arc,I feel that idea is ... Genius! If you know what I mean \ud83d\ude18</div> </div> </div> </div>I do, and it kind of forms my point.<br /> <br /> Minor templates and subsplats might be open game, particularly if it can be reworked within a pre-existing sphere, but I'm willing to bet that the bigger options won't be as easily accepted, and that's before accounting for the fact that some of the bigger fansplats have a lot of people who worked on it, and I'm willing to bet the Vault isn't prepared to handle distributing finances to everyone involved, which means it falls down to the lead contributor to ensure everyone else gets fair payment for their efforts, which in a scenario without contracts is....fraught with problems.<br /> <br /> And all of that is before you account for the fact that the idea of Genius 1E making money makes me wanna puke a little.<br /> <br /> Also what the publication of various fansplats means for those making 2E versions(like Genius 2E, which I am looking forward to).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 10-18-2018, 03:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-18T12:58:32-07:00","id":1261356,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1259978-cofd-to-be-added-to-the-storyteller-s-vault?p=1261352#post1261352\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do, and it kind of forms my point.<br /> <br /> Minor templates and subsplats might be open game, particularly if it can be reworked within a pre-existing sphere, but I'm willing to bet that the bigger options won't be as easily accepted, and that's before accounting for the fact that some of the bigger fansplats have a lot of people who worked on it, and I'm willing to bet the Vault isn't prepared to handle distributing finances to everyone involved, which means it falls down to the lead contributor to ensure everyone else gets fair payment for their efforts, which in a scenario without contracts is....fraught with problems.<br /> <br /> And all of that is before you account for the fact that the idea of Genius 1E making money makes me wanna puke a little.<br /> <br /> Also what the publication of various fansplats means for those making 2E versions.</div> </div> </div> </div>Jokes aside,you are right.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-18T13:01:50-07:00","id":1261358,"title":"","content":"Oooh, too heads, not enough hands. I see your concern, Arcane. I simply thought this is an encouraging turn of events for those wanting to jump in on the writing scene. No one is going to monetize the oh-so-scary Genius 1E. Sadly, not everyone enjoys the idea of playing a mad scientist, so I strongly doubt anyone will seek to profit from it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7106-extant-reality","name":"Extant Reality","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7106_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-18T13:08:41-07:00","id":1261360,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Extant Reality</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1259978-cofd-to-be-added-to-the-storyteller-s-vault?p=1261358#post1261358\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oooh, too heads, not enough hands. I see your concern, Arcane. I simply thought this is an encouraging turn of events for those wanting to jump in on the writing scene. No one is going to monetize the oh-so-scary Genius 1E. Sadly, not everyone enjoys the idea of playing a mad scientist, so I strongly doubt anyone will seek to profit from it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, definitely. THere's a lot to be encouraged with the Storyteller's Vault-at the end of the day, there's a lot of positives to it.<br /> <br /> But the Major Fansplats are something of a sticky widget as it goes, and it's worth pointing those out in advance for anyone who wants to pursue that. Hell, if they can come up with answers to those problems,more power to them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-18T13:20:26-07:00","id":1261362,"title":"","content":"In particular, the announced Storyteller's Vault is for fan supplements for <b>Vampire: the Requiem</b>, <b>Werewolf: the Forsaken</b>, and/or <b>Mage: the Awakened</b>. The closest you could get to <b>Genius</b> would be something along the lines of fleshing out <b>Mage Chronicler's Guide</b>'s Gifted. Which, frankly, is the sort of thing I\u2019m hoping to do: starting with something in MCG, updating it to 2e standards, and adding something new to it. <br /> <br /> I also think that write ups of Bloodlines, Lodges, and Legacies are probably fair game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-18T13:39:41-07:00","id":1261370,"title":"","content":"I would think it also covers straight up CoD/GMC supplements as well?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-18T13:41:11-07:00","id":1261371,"title":"","content":"Nope. Per there announcement, it's just VtR, WtF, and MtA. Given that the existing blue book supplements include Inferno, Immortals, Skinchangers, and Changing Breeds, I'm not surprised that it's not being opened up to Storyteller's Vault just yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\