hankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-18T14:08:06-07:00","id":1261381,"title":"","content":"Shane DeFreest, one of White Wolf's employees responded to a thread on Facebook from the Storytellers Vault announcement saying that the blue book CoD is included with the other three.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9015-zee-patrick","name":"zee PaTrick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-18T14:13:21-07:00","id":1261383,"title":"","content":"Oh. Then I stand corrected. Looking forward to a book of Horrors, then.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-18T16:08:34-07:00","id":1261415,"title":"","content":"Hopefully this means I can make a &quot;Requiem for Roanoke&quot;, detailing the Kindred of the Roanoke Valley and their various struggles and intrigues.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-18T16:47:36-07:00","id":1261429,"title":"","content":"I'm eyeing a Requiem for Tidewater, or Hampton Roads, or Greater Norfolk-Newport News-Virginia Beach. My area's got a bit of an identity crisis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9015-zee-patrick","name":"zee PaTrick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-19T04:48:06-07:00","id":1261525,"title":"","content":"And if I did a Requiem for Northern Virginia, we'll have pretty much covered the state!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-19T10:02:47-07:00","id":1261602,"title":"","content":"Huh. So sorta like legal fan fiction. Neat! How do they judge quality? Do they just put everything out and see what makes money? And is there any staff making sure thst nothing accidentally contradicts established canon or other supplements? Or is canon decided by the individual based on which supplements they use?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-19T10:55:10-07:00","id":1261615,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1259978-cofd-to-be-added-to-the-storyteller-s-vault?p=1261602#post1261602\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Huh. So sorta like legal fan fiction. Neat! How do they judge quality? Do they just put everything out and see what makes money? And is there any staff making sure thst nothing accidentally contradicts established canon or other supplements? Or is canon decided by the individual based on which supplements they use?</div> </div> </div> </div>The ST Vault does cover this. <a href=\"https://storytellersvault.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115000956751-Content-Guidelines\" target=\"_blank\">Here's what they got on content guidelines (obviously nothing on CofD stuff specifically yet). </a><br /> <br /> As for approval processes...<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b><b>Will material be approved by White Wolf before it is published on the Storytellers Vault?</b></b><br /><br /> There will not be a formal approval process by White Wolf or OneBookShelf, per se. However, if you\u2019re found to be breaking our <a href=\"http://support.dmsguild.com/hc/en-us/articles/217028818-Content-Guidelines\" target=\"_blank\"><u><b>content guidelines</b></u></a>, there will be repercussions. For example, your content can be pulled from the site, you might be ejected from the Storytellers Guild as a content creator, and you would receive no payment for copies sold. </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://storytellersvault.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115000958512-Other-Questions\" target=\"_blank\">Source</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-19T18:33:12-07:00","id":1261684,"title":"","content":"Ok, so this is what I get:<br /> <br /> * they check that it looks well put-together and uses the right formatting styles, but no editing help is provided<br /> <br /> *None of this can override major parts of canon. No shards either<br /> <br /> *doesn t seem like there is some staff committee checking that the supplements don't contradict each other or minor canon elements. This will only be annoying to the idiots like me who try to fit everything into one cohesive universe (plus timeline shards)<br /> <br /> *No creating original fictional municipalities as settings, which seems odd","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-19T22:13:05-07:00","id":1261724,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1259978-cofd-to-be-added-to-the-storyteller-s-vault?p=1261684#post1261684\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*None of this can override major parts of canon. No shards either</div> </div> </div> </div>Well because CofD doesn't have a fixed metaplot timeline the same way as WoD, that rule *might* not apply to CofD. Of course, we won't know for sure until the ST Vault for CofD is formally announced.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> *No creating original fictional municipalities as settings, which seems odd </div> </div> </div>Considering the examples they used are cities from other pre-existing, non-WW works, I believe the concern is not infringing on copyright from other works.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-20T06:17:14-07:00","id":1261755,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1259978-cofd-to-be-added-to-the-storyteller-s-vault?p=1261724#post1261724\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Considering the examples they used are cities from other pre-existing, non-WW works, I believe the concern is not infringing on copyright from other works.</div> </div> </div> </div>They went on to suggest using real-world locations though<br /> <br /> Oh. That was just a suggestion. Duh","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-20T18:54:06-07:00","id":1261868,"title":"","content":"This is awesome news, which is very welcome coming from CofD.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-26T09:41:43-07:00","id":1262890,"title":"","content":"Update! Dark Eras, Second Sight, Skinchangers, Tales of the Thirteenth Precinct, and other mortal book materials will also be unlocked from the work go.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/storytellersvault/photos/a.412026515861602/636159563448295/?type=3&amp;theater\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://scontent-atl3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t1.6435-9/44862217_636159566781628_4919513123464937472_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p168x128&amp;_nc_cat=105&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=0cb389&amp;_nc_ohc=m0hwMcLRSP8AX-ab9VG&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.xx&amp;oh=00_AfAFQPI0b46swY9BMmxjNH6jKi1Yy6kajicTlumdDWYAow&amp;oe=6441E7B8\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/storytellersvault/photos/a.412026515861602/636159563448295/?type=3&amp;theater\" target=\"_blank\"> Storytellers Vault - As previously announced the first wave Chronicles of Darkness titles are coming soon to the Storytellers Vault. There have been a number of questions regarding what will be available when it unlocks. To help clarify this in advance we would like to announce that in addition to Vampire: The Requiem, Werewolf: The Forsaken, &amp; Mage: The Awakening we will also be unlocking mortals, Dark Eras, and Mirrors. Aspiring content creators will be allowed to create products from historical timelines, alternate universes, and mortal stories as are found in products like Tales from the 13th Precinct, Second Sight or Skinchangers. There are a wide variety stories to be told and products to be made. We look forward to seeing what the content creation community produces for Chronicles of Darkness in the near future! | Facebook </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/storytellersvault/photos/a.412026515861602/636159563448295/?type=3&amp;theater\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.facebook.com/storytellersvault/photos/a.412026515861602/636159563448295/?type=3&amp;theater </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> As previously announced the first wave Chronicles of Darkness titles are coming soon to the Storytellers Vault. There have been a number of questions regarding what will be available when it unlocks.... </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/